; Control code $15: end the message with a full stop and a new line
;
; Sets D to $30 (print mode 3 of a word token) and goes to the ending in
; #R$7348: prints ".", a new line, restores the registers and returns to the
; caller of the message printer.
;
; Reached with a jump.
; .
; Hardware: prints through #R$858B and #R$8583 (story window).
@label=EndFullStop
c$7344 LD D,$30      ;
 $7346 JR $734B      ;
